<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves rise to 72.19 bln ringgit.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves rise to 72.19 bln ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves rose to 72.19 billion ringgit as at March 31 against 71.57 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities rose to 96.74 billion ringgit from 96.59 billion two weeks earlier.</p>
<p>(In bln ringgit)  March 31 1997   March 15 1997   March 30 1996</p>
<p>Reserves		 72.19	     71.57	     63.85</p>
<p>Assets		   96.74	     96.59	     89.52</p>
<p>Currency		 21.53	     22.38	     19.73</p>
<p>Govt paper		1.75		1.78		2.84</p>
